@page "/terms/{voucherId:guid?}"

<PageTitle>Terms &amp; Conditions</PageTitle>

<MudText Typo="Typo.h4" Class="mb-4">Terms &amp; Conditions</MudText>

<MudPaper Class="pa-4" Elevation="2">
    @if (VoucherId.HasValue)
    {
        <MudAlert Severity="Severity.Info" Class="mb-4">
            These terms apply to voucher <b>@VoucherId.Value</b>.
        </MudAlert>
    }

    <MudText Typo="Typo.h6" GutterBottom="true">1. General</MudText>
    <MudText Typo="Typo.body2" Class="mb-4">
        By redeeming this voucher, you agree to the following terms. The voucher is issued by the participating brand and managed through the NonCash platform.
    </MudText>

    <MudText Typo="Typo.h6" GutterBottom="true">2. Eligibility</MudText>
    <MudText Typo="Typo.body2" Class="mb-4">
        Vouchers can only be used by the registered member to whom the voucher was allocated, or by a friend who has accepted it as a gift. Vouchers are non-exchangeable for cash unless otherwise stated.
    </MudText>

    <MudText Typo="Typo.h6" GutterBottom="true">3. Validity</MudText>
    <MudText Typo="Typo.body2" Class="mb-4">
        Each voucher is valid until the expiration date shown in the voucher details. Expired vouchers cannot be redeemed, gifted, or refunded.
    </MudText>

    <MudText Typo="Typo.h6" GutterBottom="true">4. Redemption</MudText>
    <MudText Typo="Typo.body2" Class="mb-4">
        Present the voucher barcode or code to an authorized outlet staff member at the point of sale. The staff member will scan and confirm the redemption. Once a voucher is marked as used, it cannot be reused or refunded.
    </MudText>

    <MudText Typo="Typo.h6" GutterBottom="true">5. Sending a voucher as a gift</MudText>
    <MudText Typo="Typo.body2" Class="mb-4">
        Vouchers marked as giftable may be sent to another person by their phone number. A gift is never moved instantly:
        the voucher stays in the sender's wallet marked "On its way" and is reserved for the recipient for 7 days, during
        which it cannot be redeemed at the counter. The recipient must accept the gift — optionally adding a thank-you
        note that is sent to the sender — before it moves into their wallet. If the recipient declines, does not answer
        within 7 days, or the sender cancels while it is still waiting, the voucher returns to the sender's wallet
        unchanged. The sender is responsible for entering the correct recipient phone number.
    </MudText>

    <MudText Typo="Typo.h6" GutterBottom="true">6. Support</MudText>
    <MudText Typo="Typo.body2">
        For questions or disputes, contact the brand that issued the voucher or reach out to NonCash support through your app profile.
    </MudText>
</MudPaper>

@code {
    [Parameter]
    public Guid? VoucherId { get; set; }
}
